window.products.push({"id":686126,"name":"Mason Cash Innovative Kitchen Egg Store, Ceramic, Off-White, 19 x 12.5 x 6 cm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6193-Yc6QCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Innovative Kitchen range from Mason Cash - Cooking and Baking Done Smartly! New for 2018, the Innovative Kitchen collection from Mason Cash takes inspiration from the professional baker to deliver smart solutions for day-to-day kitchen tasks. Each item within the range boasts a modern twist on a traditional function that brings-about increased efficiency and improved performance.  Whether it’s a tilting mixing bowl that aids stirring and whisking, a pudding basin with a removable airtight lid, a rolling pin that also dispenses flour or an egg store with a raised central hub that prevents the need to crack them on your much-loved pans, the Innovative Kitchen collection has been thoughtfully designed and executed so that cooking and baking is both easier and more enjoyable.  The range is also complemented by an ingenious assortment of beech wood utensils that enable multiple tasks to be performed with a single hand and tool. For example, the ever-valuable slotted turner features a rack grabber within the handle so that hot oven shelves can be pulled and pushed without the need for oven gloves. The essential balloon whisk doubles-up as a reamer for extracting flavoursome juice from lemons, limes and more. The multi-function spatula contains a shaped silicone rear that is perfect for scraping awkward-to-reach jam from glass jars.  Cooking and baking done smartly - courtesy of Mason Cash. About Mason Cash - History in the Baking Since 1800 Mason Cash originated in a pottery that operated from Church Gresley, Derbyshire - the heart of the English ceramic industry - in 1800. Church Gresley was situated near to all of the raw materials and fuel sources required to manufacture ceramics. It also had the transport links that enabled the finished goods to be taken all over the UK and beyond in order to be sold.  Run by a series of ‘Master Potters’, the company became renowned worldwide for producing kitchen items that were crafted from premium-quality glazed earthenware. Although inextricably associated with their iconic range of mixing bowls, Mason Cash has worked tirelessly to develop a comprehensive understanding of the ever-evolving requirements of the modern-day cook. This has allowed the company to continue to produce innovative, functional and effective kitchenware that stands the test of time. Set Contains: 1 x Mason Cash Innovative Kitchen Stoneware Egg Store with Cracking Ridge, White","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6193-Yc6QCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mason Cash","source_asin":"B076F66JDP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076F66JDP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076F66JDP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
