window.products.push({"id":686128,"name":"Calibowl LaJolla Stack Plastic Soup/Cereal Bowls, Yellow, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7116pZscfrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The CaliBowl was designed in California and born in the surf! It's a bowl that has a patent pending revolutionary lip around the top. It's designed at an angle which pushes food onto your utensil avoiding any spillage and overflows. Like a wave in the ocean the lip pitches the food onto your desired utensil/chip or any eating medium. Whether its chips & salsa or any other type of food the versatility of the CaliBowl lends itself to endless applications. As the contents are forced to the side of the CaliBowl, the enhancement causes a gradual wave like recirculation back toward the CaliBowl’s center obtaining a no spill result. Whether you are using a chip, a spoon, chop sticks, your hand, or any other utensil the CaliBowl not only prevents the contents from spilling, but effortlessly guides the contents back toward the utensil making eating, mixing, feeding, cooking, whipping, and scooping more fun and exciting! The CaliBowl La Jolla Stack consists of 4 yellow plastic 3 cup soup/cereal bowls with the CaliBowl no-spill lip. This is the most versatile bowl for the whole family and the perfect size for just about anything: cereal, soup, guacamole dip. The bowls are made of food grade Polypropylene, making them exceptionally durable and shatterproof, and feature a non skid base. They are microwavable and top rack dishwasher safe and the sleek design makes for easy cleaning. They are BPA free and manufactured using partially recycled material.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7116pZscfrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CaliBowl","source_asin":"B002VPCXG6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686128","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002VPCXG6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002VPCXG6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":686129,"name":"ACEVIDA Drinking Straws 10.5 inches, 316 Stainless Steel Reusable Straws with Cleaning Brush and Pouch, Metal Straws for 30oz 20oz Tumblers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zD-6RsRKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"ACEVIDA Set of 6 Stainless Steel Straws, 8.5inches and 10.5inches: *Length:8.5/10.5 inches *Package:6 straws (3 bents, 3 straight), 3 cleaning brushes *Made by 316 stainless steel, keep beverage with its original taste. *BPA free Specification: A DELUXE SET OF STRAWS: Set of 6pcs stainless steel reusable straws. Include 3 bents, 3 straight and 3 cleaning brushes. Perfect for drinking coffee, fresh juice, coke, water. HIGH QUALITY: All made by medical grade 316 stainless steel, very different from normal 18/8(304) stainless steel, it’s fully resistant to oxidation and corrosion, which can keep your beverage tasting nice. EASY TO CLEAN: Each set comes with cleaning brush, you can easy cleaning the interior of each straw. Also, the straw is dishwasher safe. ON-THE-GO: Package includes a portable bag; you can always carry your ACEVIDA straws where you go. Pop straws and cleaning brush into the portable bag so you can enjoy beverage with straw all the time. ECO FRIENDLY: ACEVIDA straw made by medical grade stainless steel. This BPA FREE reusable straw is great for the environment. With ACEVIDA metal straw, you don’t need to use the disposable straw anymore. What is 316 stainless steel? Similar to 304 stainless steel, 316 stainless steel has high amount of chromium (18%) and nickel (10%). A major different between 304 and 316 is the chemical composition, 316 contains 2% molybdenum. The higher molybdenum content results in 316 processing increased corrosion resistance and better acid alkali resistant. Common application of 316 stainless steel include: -Medical equipment. -Chemical processing and storage equipment -Marine environments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zD-6RsRKL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ACEVIDA","source_asin":"B07J69GDP6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07J69GDP6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07J69GDP6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
