window.products.push({"id":686171,"name":"LIUCOGXI 4.3\" Rose Ceramic Flower Art Wall Decor Set of 2 Handcrafted 3D Artificial Blue Rose Hanging Sculptures for Living Room Home Hallway Bedroom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hCJLyWTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Detail Material: ceramic  Size:4.3*4.3*1.6 inches Color: Blue Easy hanging design: Embedded a hook at the back of flower,easy for you to hang on the wall, Be used to hide any unwanted marks, dents or scratches on the wall. Installation: Place the included white thumbtack on the wall, then tap the metal part with a hammer until it is fully in the wall. Then hang the loop on the back of the ceramic flower on the thumbtack. Warm Tips: 1. Ceramic material is fragile; please handle with care. 2. Do not place ceramic flower in direct sunlight or an overly humid environment. 3. Keep away from colored liquids like tea, coffee, and juice; ceramic can be easily stained. 4. There will be slight color difference due to different monitors. 5. There will be a slight error in the size measured manually.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hCJLyWTEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIUCOGXI","source_asin":"B09MK6HXYR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MK6HXYR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MK6HXYR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":686172,"name":"Dreamfoam Bedding 2 inch Foam Mattress Topper, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21JW-JQAcoL._AC_.jpg","description":"Revitalize your aging mattress with this mattress topper. The fast response conventional foam will add comfort and increase the quality of sleep mattress immediately. It’s a great way to add a bit of plushness to a firm mattress too. Made in the USA with CertiPUR-US foam. What CertiPUR-US means.-- Made without ozone depleters, PBDEs, TDCPP or TCEP (“Tris”) flame retardants, mercury, lead, heavy metals, formaldehyde, or phthalates regulated by the Consumer Product Safety Commission. No chlorofluorocarbons (CFCs), low VOC. The foams are performance-tested, durability-tested, emissions-tested, and content-tested by independent, accredited testing laboratories","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21JW-JQAcoL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dreamfoam Bedding","source_asin":"B00WJ09ZJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WJ09ZJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WJ09ZJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":686173,"name":"City to Cottage Handmade Red and White Polka Dot Large Ceramic 1,7l/60oz/4-6 Cup Teapot, Milk Jug, Sugar Bowl Set, Pottery Tea Set, Housewarming Gift ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FNePu3sJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simple but impressive reasons to buy this product: Most certainly a perfect birthday present, christmas gift or anniversary surprise: City to Cottage’s unique, vintage, french style parisian porcelain ceramic tea sets provide you with the foolproof idea when you just don’t know what to get for your friend’s retirement party, your niece’s engagement party or your mother’s birthday.Manufactured, handmade and hand glazed in Europe, this tea set has an inexpensive, affordable price point but an amazingly fresh, quality style. At the moment you lift any of our products you can just tell that we have not compromised on quality.Catering to the whole family, our tea sets include a large tea pot that has a classic design and it holds 1700 ml of fluid, enough for 4-6 standard sized mugs of tea and pours brilliantly without dripping - no more hard-to-remove tea stains on your tablecloth!The handle is a good size for picking up easily, a full pot isn't overly heavy to lift and the spout pours without any drips or dribbles.A milk jug accompanies the pot - it is what you would consider decent sized, so if you are expecting a more standard sized creamer, look no further! You can also use the jug for serving the sauce with fish or serving gravy on a roast dinner.Finally, a beautiful sugar bowl that comes is the perfect size, with cute design and incredible value for money that in itself would also make a sweet Valentine’s gift - pun intended!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FNePu3sJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"City to Cottage","source_asin":"B0771W8PMP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0771W8PMP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0771W8PMP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
