window.products.push({"id":686201,"name":"ONEVER Beauty and The Beast Rose Set, Enchanted Silk Red Roses in Glass Dome with LED Fairy String Lights Wooden Base for Wedding Anniversary Valentin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GUgTHBqtS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TENSEE - A professional team on Amazon more than 5 years, which deals only with the development of products. We commit ourselves to using qualitative products to improve the quality of life. Features Build-in 2pcs artificial silk rose, 18cm length, Just put it in the glass, cut the rose length according to your need, insert it into the small hole on wooden base. Made of high copper wire, flexible, IP20 waterproof, durable for daily use.The 20-LED string is about 2m/6.6ft long, it's made with a fine bendable copper wire  that create any shape you want , and add a beautiful decorative accent. Powered by 3*AAA battery(not included), turn on the switch, led strip light bright warm white lighting.Perfect to any decorative or holiday project, suitable for party, wedding, indoor decoration, etc. Specifications Type: LED Strip lightMaterial: copper wire + Glass+ WoodenLED Quantity: 20pcsLight Color: Warm WhiteSwitch: ON/OFFPowered By: 3*AAA Battery(not included)Glass Lampshade Height: 20cm / 7.9\"Glass Lampshade Inner Diameter: 8.5cm / 3.3\"Glass Lampshade Thickness: 2.3mmWooden Base: 11.1*2.1cm / 4.4*0.8\"(D*H)Net Weight: 0.332kg / 11.7oz Package 1*LED Strip with Wooden Base1*Glass Lampshade2*Artificial Silk Rose1*Package Box Warming Tips Because of the packing problem, the roses may be out of shape when you receive them. Please don't worry about it, for the roses are easily recovering from distortion. Please use your hands gently move rose petals until it returns to its natural shape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GUgTHBqtS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ONEVER","source_asin":"B07VCQCN7X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686201","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VCQCN7X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VCQCN7X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
