window.products.push({"id":686269,"name":"Greater Goods Party of Four Cook Kit - 10 Piece Nonstick Cookware Set for a Complete Kitchen | Non Toxic, Teflon Free Pots and Pans Work on All Cookin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":174.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C+QB-itWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cook Smart, Cook Non-Toxic: Non-toxic and nonstick are now synonyms! With the Greater Goods savvy ceramic cookware kit, get the best in non-toxic cookware. No PTFEs, no PFOAs, no lead, none of the stuff that kills birds and is found in teflon. Super Slick Nonstick: With our proprietary savvy ceramic coating, you barely even need to use oils or butter. This ceramic pots and pans set is as nonstick as it possibly gets. It’s All About the Feel: This pan set is light and strong. It feels good in the hand, is easy to maneuver, and it will last as the workhorse of your kitchen. Everything You Want: Cookware sets never check all the boxes. Until the Greater Goods savvy ceramic party of 4 cook kit came around. Everything your kitchen needs to make all the meals you want time and again. The Complete Cookware Set: In this kit you’ll find a saute pan, frying pan, sauce pot, stock pot, 3 tempered glass lids, and some bonus goodies for completing your kitchen. Spice Things Up: Cookware deserves to look cool in addition to performing excellently. That’s why we really put an eye toward the details. A set that’s modern, cool, timeless, and a tiny bit nostalgic. Cook Anything, Anywhere: This is induction cookware capable of working on all cooking surfaces thanks to an extra-large stainless steel base. It’ll heat evenly and quickly regardless of whether you’re cooking with gas, electric, induction, or in the oven. Best Handles in the League: The handles on these pans are as ergonomic as it gets and perfectly light for easy maneuvering. They’ve got built in slots for utensils. And the lids can rest easy and upside down on any counter. Values Matter: At the end of the day, maybe the best thing about this nonstick pots and pans set is that it’s priced affordably—especially compared to other brands—for any family looking to make their kitchen happier and healthier and up their cooking game. True Support: Our friendly team in St. Louis are industry experts at-the-ready to assist you with any questions that might arise about your non toxic cookware set. We take pride in our work and want you to have a great experience from beginning to end.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C+QB-itWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greater Goods","source_asin":"B0BYR3KL2X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYR3KL2X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYR3KL2X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
