window.products.push({"id":686271,"name":"Luvan 8Cup/2L/68oz Bacon Grease Container with Strainer, Cooking Oil Container, Stainless Steel Oil Filter Pot with Strainer, Dustproof Lid and Coaste","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YKi4OErGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large Capacity】 --- The 2L capacity is the perfect size for filtering and storing grease. It safely holds large amounts of grease, filtering out the small lumps left on the bacon cubes so that the oil can be reused for additional frying or cooking without taking up a lot of space on the counter. With a very attractive silver metallic color and well designed, the grease can is a perfect addition to any kitchen, stove or counter. 【Durable Material】 --- Bacon grease container machine body made of high quality stainless with wooden handle . which can resist rust and corrosion. The pot body is thick and not easy to break, and the service life is longer. The metal stainless steel fine mesh filter helps us separate food from grease, and the sturdy construction makes filtration safer and more hygienic. 【Ideal Tool for Storing Oil】 --- The ergonomic wooden handle is easy to grip and comfortable, so you can easily pour the oil back into pan, skillet or deep fryer. Without worrying about the handle burning your hands that you have to wait for the pot to cool before touching it.The cover or lid can cover the pot completely to prevents debris or airborne dust particles out of oil keeping the oil clean and safe to use again. 【Easily & Quickly】 --- The stainless steel cooking oil keeper comes with a silicone saucer to catch any drippings running down the sides, preventing oil from running on the countertop.The edge small pouring port is designed to be more rapid in the process of pouring oil, which can prevent any leakage. With the Luvan Kitchen Bacon Grease Container helps prevent messes and keeps your kitchen clean and tidy. 【Customer service】 --- Bacon Grease Makes Everything Better. With the Luvan Stainless Steel Cooking Oil Container With Lid & Handle, you can now store the precious smokey & savory flavor of pure grease with ease.Perfect for home and restaurant kitchen to filter, store and reuse used cooking oil, coconut oil, bacon grease, fat, frying oil, hot oil, and so on, also can be used to store other liquid seasonings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YKi4OErGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luvan","source_asin":"B0B7S13YFJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686271","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7S13YFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7S13YFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
