window.products.push({"id":686307,"name":"Evaporative Air Cooler, Cooling Fan Swamp Fan w/3 Modes, 3 Speeds, Touch Panel, 50° Oscillation,12H Timer, 2 Ice Packs, Space Saving, Oscillating Quie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iwbE4yHqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAY BYE TO THE SUMMER HEAT - Powered by 3 speeds (low, medium, high) and 3 modes (normal, sleep, natural), this evaporative air cooler generates a customize gentle breeze stream to cool down this hot summer days. It is a very quiet device, and you will barely get any sound from it even on the highest setting. ENJOY COOL AIR IN HOT SUMMER- Sunday Living evaporative cooler can lower room temperature and promote cooling airflow through the advanced water calculation system. Featured with 50°oscillation, this portable swamp cooler oscillating quiet with remote will cover a wide cooling range, delivering pleasant coolness to fresh whole rooms. SAFETY FEATURES, OF COURSE INCLUDED - A built-in narrow front grille features, this air cooler can prevent accidental finger touch, providing additional safety for families with children and pets. It’s an evaporative air cooler for small areas, which can be used with or without air conditioning, or as a humidifier, or just as a large swamp cooler without the cooling/humidifying. PORTABLE & SPACE SAVING DESIGN - Standing 34 inches tall with a small 8 x 10 inches footprint, the sleek design is easy to fit in corners and tight spaces, which can provide you cool wind and also save your space. The convenient carry handle on the top make this evaporative tower fan easy to move from room to room. A tower fan can be suitable for a variety space: living room, bedroom, dorm and office. LARGE CAPACITY DESIGN FOR LONG TERM USE - Large capacity water tank (1.3 gallon) ensures this portable air cooler can blow out moist breeze for 5-6H without frequently refilling water. Besides, adding ice boxes to the water tank can bring surprisingly cooling feeling. Sunday Living air cooler brings you with cooling and humid breeze to beat this hot summer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iwbE4yHqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5 SUNDAY LIVING","source_asin":"B09F6C6TF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686307","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F6C6TF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F6C6TF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
