window.products.push({"id":686338,"name":"NOVICA Good Luck 183031 \"Calm Blue Elephant Celadon Ceramic Oil Warmer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412AebtUrxL._AC_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: Proud and regal, the elephant is a traditional symbol of Thailand. Duangkamol transforms it into an oil warmer and for the soothing scents of aromatherapy. The elephant's celadon ceramic body features a basin for the oils while a tea light sits inside the hollow body. - Features a crackled finish - Candle(s) included - For use with tealights only - Never leave a burning candle unattended - Surface may become warm or hot during use; place on a protected surface - Keep away from children and pets - Aromatic oils not included About our Artist: Duangkamol Srisukri is from Bangkok. 'Most of my works are Thai and Chinese reproductions like vases, ginger jars, and figurines,' she says. 'My intention is to maintain the ancient art of celadon and stoneware so that future generations can enjoy these pieces. Together with other artists, we have created beautiful hand-crafted pieces with ornate incisions and bas relief. Each piece that I make has many stories to tell. Each piece is individually signed by the artist who has worked on it.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/412AebtUrxL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B0082HCJ8O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0082HCJ8O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0082HCJ8O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
