window.products.push({"id":686398,"name":"Mohavy Original Smith V Wood Agarwood Oud Chips Aquilaria Bakhoor Incense","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jtoeebNrL._AC_.jpg","description":"This sizable chunk of 100% original Oud Argarwood is the world's best for creating that unmistakable spicy aroma that relaxes nerves and elevates the mind. Agarwood brings your chunk from deep in Eastern jungles where only 1 in 10 trees have the prized Oud deposits at their core. Argarwood trees create this valuable substance to defend against disease. You wouldn't be wrong to consider it nature's most powerful defense and natural wellness miracle. No wonder one highly quality chunk of Oud can fill your room or area with spectacular spicy scent for hours. This is exactly what you need for deep relaxation, mental stimulation, and even the ability to communicate with the Beyond. Millions of families worldwide insist on first class Oud Agarwood for special occasions and everyday enjoyment. Keep in mind this a natural product where package contents can vary. We take great pride in filling every package with enough premium Oud chunk to please you for hours. Place the chunk on a wood fire or electric burner. Do no heat along with food, food preparation, on the grill, or the fireplace. The Oud should have its own heating source. Light the chunk for a few minutes until the fire goes down and the chunk starts burning. After a short while you will notice the much loved scent filling the room. It's a mix of wood and resin that provides the famous spicy aroma. Order your Mohavy Oud Agarwood Chunk while supplies are plentiful!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51jtoeebNrL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mohavy","source_asin":"B011MO4J6I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686398","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B011MO4J6I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B011MO4J6I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
