window.products.push({"id":686581,"name":"Pyrex Bakeware 11-by-7-Inch Rectangular Baking Dish, Cobalt","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4159MFZ2R3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Pyrex Bakeware cobalt 11-inch by 7-inch by 1-1/2-inch rectangular baking dish includes 1-each 11-inch by 7-inch by 1-1/2-inch cobalt rectangular baking dish. Pyrex Bakeware is durable, transparent for easy monitoring of baking progress and provides good heat conduction for even, consistent baking. There's no substitute for Pyrex, the original glass bakeware. Introduced 90 years ago and made of a durable, high temperature material, Pyrex remains the ideal medium for safe, dependable food preparation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4159MFZ2R3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pyrex","source_asin":"B0000CFPEQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000CFPEQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000CFPEQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":686582,"name":"Ramekins 8Oz Oven Safe, Porcelain Souffle Custard Cups Dishwasher Safe and Microwave Safe, Flower-Shaped Condiments Cups, Set of 6, Navy","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hx5areotL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy Storage and Maintenance: Our custard cups are stackable and don't take up much space in your cupboard due to the flower shape and a rigorous stack test. This makes them ideal for parties as they are easy to carry stacked. The ramekins are easy to clean as they have an interior and exterior glaze to protect ramekins against stains, making them easy to clean, so you don’t have to worry about sauces. You can wash them with soap and hot water or place them in your dishwasher. Withstand Tough Conditions: Our bulk restaurant ramekins are made of premium quality porcelain and are lead-free and cadmium-free. It is also chip-resistant and sturdy. You can use them in the dishwasher, microwave oven, and freezer. They can withstand temperatures above 500℉ and do not absorb any flavors and colors, ensuring nothing leaches in your food. Suited for Different Activities: This ceramic dinnerware is made from porcelain which makes it rugged for different uses plus, it is larger than most ramekins making it perfect for preparing crème Brulee, ice cream, soufflé, dipping sauces, lava cakes, French onion soup, snacks, quiche, pudding Brulee and condiment cups. It is perfect for garden tea parties, bridal showers, weddings, family reunions, birthdays, anniversaries, and holiday celebrations. Dishwasher and Microwave Safe: Made of high-quality, durable materials. Each dish in the set is 100% porcelain. The material is Microwave, freezer and dishwasher safe. The plates can withstand a wide range of temperatures from a minimum of 5 ℉ and 572 ℉. The smooth surface of the dinner dish makes it easy to clean. Just rinse it with warm water and soap or put it in the dishwasher for quick cleaning and the bottom of the dish is unglazed, non-slip and won't scratch your table. Perfect Gift Idea: This beautiful set of porcelain souffle bowls is a perfect housewarming gift, Christmas gift wedding gift and is great for new couples, new homes, and new beginnings. This ceramic everyday dining set is a great option for you to give as a gift to your dearest friends and families. They will be delighted to receive these practical and modern plates. Matches Different Decor: This dinnerware ramekin set is flower-shaped, navy blue, and glazed for a timeless look suited for outdoor and indoor events such as kitchen use, family or friends gathering, parties, BBQs, camping, a picnic, and recreational vehicles. It is also perfect for enjoying an indoor dinner with your loved ones or taking them outside to enhance your décor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hx5areotL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUSTIDE","source_asin":"B0BGX7ZW7D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686582","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGX7ZW7D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGX7ZW7D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
