window.products.push({"id":686889,"name":"HOME-X Set of 6 Strawberry Kitchen Clips for Chips, Snacks, and Laundry - 1 3/4\" L x 1 1/2\" W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NZYCb-G9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you tired of cheap plastic clips that constantly break or chip? There's nothing more frustrating at snack time or laundry time than having to figure out how to seal a bag or hang clothes to dry when the cheap clip you were relying on lets you down. If you're looking for versatile, multipurpose clips for food packages, laundry, and many other household uses, look no further. They measure: 1 3/4\" L x 1 1/2\" W x 1 1/4\" H. These are the perfect chip or snack clips, but they are so much more! In the laundry room, they can hold fine hand washables for drying, and they make dealing with wet towels and swimsuits a piece of cake. This set of 6 strawberry kitchen and laundry clips has you covered. The cute, fashion-forward strawberry design will make you smile as you whip through your household chores. Even the kids will enjoy putting their food away and tightly sealing the containers for storage with these fun, snack-time accessories. These easy-to-use, ergonomic clips are made of durable, high-quality premium plastic. They also feature a sturdy hinge and flat backing for tightly gripping snacks, laundry, or anything else you use them on. Aside from the kitchen or laundry room, you can also use these decorative clips as holders for kid's artwork or to organize your home office. Get those precious photos, pictures, and handmade art pieces out of the drawer and onto the wall in a cute display with these adorable clips.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NZYCb-G9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B089QW2K8R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686889","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089QW2K8R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089QW2K8R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
