window.products.push({"id":686956,"name":"Le Cadeaux Solid Yellow Melamine 12-Inch Coupe Oval Platter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ctG5-ccHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Great for entertaining outdoors or at your dining table, these Le Cadeaux solid yellow melamine 12 inch coupe oval platter, inspired by hand-painted italian and french ceramics, is both durable and attractive. This serving platter features a hardy melamine construction, that won't chip or break, with a tuscan gold background, designed to complement and mix and match with all of the Le Cadeaux pattern dinnerware pieces. The design is so beautifully executed, you'll be amazed how closely this platter resembles a hand-painted ceramic piece. Pair with additional Le Cadeaux dinnerware for a matching set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ctG5-ccHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Cadeaux","source_asin":"B002AKK7WY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002AKK7WY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002AKK7WY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":686957,"name":"CODY FOSTER & CO. Hand Crafted Wool Angel Mouse Christmas Tree Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sbRa4OMJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"IMAGINATIVE CODY FOSTER DESIGN: Created by owner Cody Foster UNIQUE GIFT: Whimsical angel mouse perfect gift for kids, birthdays, nursery, chirstmas ORNAMENTS: Each mouse is entirely hand-sewn, glued and glittered in a series of labor-intensive steps to achieve this precious look MATERIAL: Soft, lightweight woolen felt with metal crown and gold glittered star wand SIZE: Ornament Dimensions in Inches: 3.5 x 5","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sbRa4OMJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CODY FOSTER & CO.","source_asin":"B07XDM6F2N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XDM6F2N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XDM6F2N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":686958,"name":"Posh Home Queen Size Quilt Set Jersey Knit Cotton Blend Blanket White Bedspread Light Coverlet Summer Bedding Quilted Bedspreads Lightweight Comforter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713TvVCmk4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our quilt is a bed topper with multiple layers joined together by a jersey knit fabric top; an insulating layer of polyester batting; and a jersey knit fabric bottom layer. The layers are joined through a process called — wait for it — “quilting.” Although quilting might call to mind handcrafted designs ranging from homey to stunning, the term simply refers to stitching through all of the quilt’s layers at once to join them. The inner layer of a quilt tends to be thinner, which means that most don’t have a significant amount of loft to make them puffy. Our 120 GSM down alternative batting adds warmth to the quilt, while, our blended cotton fibers are great for keeping things cool. Who Is a Quilt Best For? People who sleep hot. Because they’re relatively thin and lightweight, quilts are a good option for hot sleepers. Those in warm climates. Lighter-weight covers may help keep you more comfortable (and cut down on your A/C bill) when the weather’s warm and you want to stay cool. Anyone who’s all about layers. If you like to layer a blanket under your top cover or drape a throw over it a lightweight quilt could help prevent your multi-layered approach from becoming too warm. Pros: Not bulky, Good choice for keeping cool, Great decorative accent. Cons: No loft for those who like a fluffier look, May not be warm enough by itself for cold weather","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713TvVCmk4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Posh Home","source_asin":"B0BQRPGC5H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-686958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQRPGC5H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQRPGC5H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
